czmqpp
------------------------------------------
C++ wrapper for czmq

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libczmq++-devel-1.2.0+git20160505-1bl1
  libczmq++0-1.2.0+git20160505-1bl1
  libczmq3-3.0.2-1bl1
  libczmq3-devel-3.0.2-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libczmq3-devel-3.0.2-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libzmq-devel-4.3.5-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/zeromq/czmqpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/zeromq/czmqpp.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack czmqpp-1.2.0+git20160505-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./czmqpp-1.2.0+git20160505-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/czmqpp-1.2.0+git20160505-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/czmqpp-1.2.0+git20160505-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libczmq++0-1.2.0+git20160505-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libczmq++-devel-1.2.0+git20160505-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

